@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = replace-with-login-token
@email = traveler@example.com
@challengeId = replace-with-register-code-response-challenge-id
@verificationCode = replace-with-six-digit-code-from-email
@legacyToken = replace-with-legacy-login-token
@bindingChallengeId = replace-with-binding-code-response-challenge-id
@bindingCode = replace-with-six-digit-binding-code-from-email
@jobId = job-id
@tripId = trip-id

### 存活与就绪
GET {{base}}/healthz

###
GET {{base}}/readyz

### 发送注册验证码（请把 email 换成自己的邮箱；邮件中的验证码不会出现在 API 响应）
# 200 data: challenge_id / expires_in（剩余秒数）/ retry_after（重发等待秒数）
# 429 AUTH_RATE_LIMITED: body.retry_after 和 Retry-After 响应头均为秒数
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register/code
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### 验证邮箱并注册（填入上一步 challenge_id 和邮件中的 6 位验证码；201 返回 User，不返回 token）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"example-password","code":"{{verificationCode}}","challenge_id":"{{challengeId}}"}

### 邮箱密码登录（200 data.token，8 小时有效；密码 8–72 UTF-8 字节）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"example-password"}

### 旧账号迁移入口（仅尚未绑定邮箱的既有账号；与新注册流程二选一）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/legacy/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"existing-legacy-username","password":"existing-legacy-password"}

### 旧账号申请绑定验证码（使用 legacy/login 返回的 token）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/email/code
Authorization: Bearer {{legacyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### 旧账号验证并绑定邮箱（沿用原密码、ID、角色、行程和会话；绑定后使用邮箱登录）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/email
Authorization: Bearer {{legacyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","code":"{{bindingCode}}","challenge_id":"{{bindingChallengeId}}"}

### 当前用户（email 未绑定时为空字符串，email_verified 为 false；业务请求将返回 403 EMAIL_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED）
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 搜索地点
GET {{base}}/api/v1/places?city=杭州市&keyword=博物馆&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 管理员按搜索返回的地点 ID 建档
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"place-id-from-search","duration_minutes":120,"tags":["文化"],"open_minute":540,"close_minute":1020,"fee_cents":6000,"fee_source":"景点公开票价页","active":true}

### 管理员完整替换可编辑资料；未知值使用 null
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/admin/places/place-id-from-search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"duration_minutes":150,"tags":["文化"],"open_minute":null,"close_minute":null,"fee_cents":null,"fee_source":"","active":true,"version":1}

### 创建规划任务
POST {{base}}/api/v1/planning-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: planning-request-1

{
  "constraints": {
    "city": "杭州市",
    "start_date": "2026-10-01",
    "end_date": "2026-10-03",
    "party_size": 2,
    "budget_cents": 200000,
    "budget_scope": "per_person",
    "interests": ["文化", "美食"],
    "pace": "balanced",
    "transport": "transit"
  }
}

### 每 2 秒查询任务，直到最终状态；排队和领取后执行各最多 300 秒
# 异步失败时本请求仍为 HTTP 200，查看 data.status 与 data.error.code/message/status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/planning-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 仅 failed 或 interrupted 任务可以重试
POST {{base}}/api/v1/planning-jobs/{{jobId}}/retries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: retry-request-1

### 任务成功后查询完整行程
# constraints.transport 是偏好；按每段 route.mode 渲染实际 walking/transit
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 行程摘要列表
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 手动修改完整可编辑计划；活动 ID 来自当前行程
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-edit-request-1

{"expected_version":3,"plan":{"title":"杭州三日","summary":"减少步行","activities":[{"id":"activity-id-from-current-trip","date":"2026-10-02","start_minute":600,"end_minute":720,"kind":"sightseeing","place_id":"place-id-from-current-trip","title":"博物馆","reason":"文化兴趣"}]}}

### 局部重规划；ID 必须替换为当前行程响应里的实际活动 ID
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/replanning-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: replan-request-1

{
  "expected_version": 3,
  "scope": {
    "date": "2026-10-02",
    "start_minute": 540,
    "end_minute": 1080,
    "editable_item_ids": ["activity-id-from-current-trip"],
    "locked_item_ids": []
  },
  "instruction": "下午减少步行。"
}

### 预算汇总
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 版本摘要
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/versions?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 指定历史版本
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/versions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 注销
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
